{"seq":24,"trial_id":"v03-opus-dev-2026-10/hermes-opus-gbrain-told-company-mu-v03-dev/si-03-quarrendon-seat-count/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-01T09:34:42.751Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"55da3a376d8cc05d5c37ad88eb0adff9f2ea6dddcb485ff838242660c64c0486","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV03OPU0002","text":"Hi Dana. Amendment No. 1 for Quarrendon Freight Lines sets the Pemberline Dock subscription at 185 seats. It was signed on 2025-08-19 and took effect on 2025-09-01.\n\nOne thing for the deck: Amendment No. 3, signed 2026-09-22, raises the count to 230 seats, but not until 2027-01-01. So 185 is still the current number today."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV03OPU0002","ts":"1791987000.000130"}}
